{{JPExclusive}}'''Volcano Golem''' (ボルケーノゴーレム - Borukenogoremu) is an enemy that appears in [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Volcano Golem
|image = E 229.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,000円 - 7,900円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has good amounts of health, damage, long range, and a chance to [[Slow|slow]] down your units. However, he has slow movement speed, and a slow attack rate.

